        "Window2": {
            "Body": "You're facing the window. The only taste of hope, the only taste of joy you've been granted. A glimpse into the spirit world, for the one who hoped to glimpse what lies beyond it, they said. You can't decide if you're grateful or not, to have it on this side of your cell. Every night, by the light of the rising moon, you can see the grand Altar outside. A resplendent memory of everything you've lost. Beautiful and devastating.",
            "ConditionalBody": [
                {
                    "Text": "Silhouetted by the rising moon, you see the Altar of Wild Spirits jutting up from the rippling grassland outside. The form of the idol you used to worship there -- and the memory of the freedom it could grant -- is seared into your mind once again. But it's doomed to forever be a dream, it seems. The wild oak from which that idol must be carved is, as you remember all too well, found outside the door behind you.",
                    "Conditions": [
                        {
                            "Condition": "time",
                            "ConditionValue": "2"
                        },
                        {
                            "Condition": "gameState",
                            "ConditionValue": "1"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "Text": "For some reason, though, gazing upon it feels different this time. As if another pair of eyes is here with you, beholding its divine form, drawing upon its radiant energy.",
                    "Conditions": [
                        {
                            "Condition": "time",
                            "ConditionValue": "2"
                        },
                        {
                            "Condition": "gameState",
                            "ConditionValue": "1"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ],
            "ShowTime": "",
            "Choices": [
                {
                    "Text": "Turn Right",
                    "Target": "Altar2"
                },
                {
                    "Text": "Wait Here",
                    "Call": "wait"
                },
                {
                    "Text": "Turn Left",
                    "Target": "Table2"
                }
            ]
        },
