            "Body": "You're facing the altar, carved in deep obsidian relief from the thick wall on this side of your cell. Its breath cycle is so clear as to distract you, even when you're looking elsewhere. When you're facing this way, it's hard to sense anything besides it. Every day, you feel the hunger from its offering bowl ebb and flow with the light of the sun.",
            "ShowAltarState": "",
            "Choices": [
