        "OutsideTable2": {
            "Body": "You're heading around the great obsidian trunk of the tree that was your prison for so long.",
            "ShowTime": "",
            "Choices": [
                {
                    "Text": "Go to the altar",
                    "Target": "AltarWildSpirits"
                },
                {
                    "Text": "Go to the door",
                    "Target": "OutsideDoor2"
                }
            ]
        },
        "AltarWildSpirits": {
            "Body": "You're standing before the Altar of Wild Spirits. If the aura of energy from your cell's alter was overwhelming, this aura is all-encompassing. You feel yourself shrinking before the enormity of the universes it holds, the possibilities it represents. As always, you know there is only one offering fit for this moment -- an offering from another world, to satisfy that which created them all.",
            "ShowAltarState": "",
            "ShowTime": "",
            "Choices": [
                {
                    "Text": "Go around the house",
                    "Target": "OutsideTable2"
                },
                {
                    "Text": "Wait Here",
                    "Call": "wait"

                },
                {
                    "Text": "Place Idol",
                    "Conditions": [
                        {
                            "Condition": "idol",
                            "ConditionValue": "inventory"
                        }
                    ],
                    "Call": "putIdol"
                },
                {
                    "Text": "Get Idol",
                    "Conditions": [
                        {
                            "Condition": "idol",
                            "ConditionValue": "AltarWildSpirits"
                        }
                    ],
                    "Call": "getIdol"
                },
                {
                    "Text": "Invoke Gods",
                    "Conditions": [
                        {
                            "Condition": "idol",
                            "ConditionValue": "AltarWildSpirits"
                        },
                        {
                            "Condition": "time",
                            "ConditionValue": "0"
                        },
                        {
                            "Condition": "gameState",
                            "ConditionValue": "3"
                        }
                    ],
                    "Call": "learnRoomKey"
                }
            ]
        },
        "gameWin": {
            "Body": "And so the glimpse into another world was given unto them both. As the gods severed their bond and they went their separate ways, the memories of that time stuck with them -- of the existence of forces and places neither had before known, and neither would ever see or sense again. It comforted them in a sense, though, to know that there truly was something more out there. Something beyond the boundaries of the knowable, of the understandable. It might have been an overwhelming thing to know for some, but for them, it brought no fear -- just a sense of wonder at what might be right in front of them, beyond what they could first perceive."
        }
    }
}